<title>USA: Envirotest names new COO.</title>
<headline>Envirotest names new COO.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Envirotest Systems Corp on Friday said it has named Richard Webb as its new executive vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>The position previously had been vacant, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>Webb holds over 25 years of experience in management jobs with a focus on operations and finances. He has been chief executive officer and co-owner of Ambac International, a supplier of engineered systems to the auto industry. He also has held senior positions at United Technologies Corp and Carrier Corp.</p>
</text>
